              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mekala mbee wake, ĩkithathi kwĩanana na ũkithathi wayo, na ĩlumaita kwĩanana na ũlumaita wayo: na ala andũ maseng’a ene kwa ene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
